WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.935
Day one is a check, not a lesson.

2
00:00:02.385 --> 00:00:03.659
It shows you where to start.

3
00:00:04.359 --> 00:00:08.591
You hold the grown-up page. Your child gets the page with the big letters.

4
00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:11.555
There are three parts, and one question for you.

5
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:16.212
Part A. Point to each letter in the first row. Your child says its sound.

6
00:00:16.662 --> 00:00:21.195
You are listening for the sound, not the name of the letter. These are the eight sounds.

7
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:27.616
As in nest.

8
00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:31.868
As in moon.

9
00:00:32.468 --> 00:00:37.045
If you hear the name of a letter, do not correct it. Your page tells you how to mark it.

10
00:00:37.495 --> 00:00:44.464
Part B. Now it goes the other way. Tap a sound under this video, and your child points to its letter in the second row.

11
00:00:44.914 --> 00:00:49.263
Some children can find a sound before they can say it. That is a good sign.

12
00:00:49.713 --> 00:00:55.641
Part C. Point to each of the four pictures, and say its name. Ask: what sound does it start with?

13
00:00:56.091 --> 00:01:02.409
Then answer one question yourself. Has your child learned sounds before, and lost them by the next day?

14
00:01:02.859 --> 00:01:06.532
Do not teach, and do not correct today. Just listen and mark.

15
00:01:06.982 --> 00:01:12.698
Then read the yellow box at the bottom of your page, from the top. Stop at the first line that fits.

16
00:01:13.148 --> 00:01:17.548
It may tell you this plan is too easy for your child. Then it tells you where to go.

17
00:01:17.998 --> 00:01:22.676
Write the three numbers on the page, and keep it. You will look at it again on the last day.
